<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Valero Energy started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Valero Energy started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Jim Falvey has started coverage of Valero Energy Corp with a rating of outperform, a source at the brokerage said Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the San Antonio company opened unchanged at 32.</p>
<p>((--Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
